{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f79ec087498e11eb09d14a5e00fdcb60beb1fb1bd30356addcdb2ba3202fcc5", "ja": "（今度の琴葉の衣装は、キンモクセイの妖精が\nイメージだ。気に入ってくれてるといいんだけど）", "zh": "（琴叶这次的服装是以丹桂妖精为设计形象，\n希望她会喜欢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "125201e075f7d9ad71f211fbb75e3cef15f99bbc1fdd495aa062a3ccce348193", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n勝手にすみません。ちょっと試着してました。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n不好意思，我自作主张试穿了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "34d1a1b719e5328027b814aed9e653087929d3f1cab32c4f7b27eccd23c65b42", "ja": "いや、構わないよ。\nそれより琴葉、新しい衣装の着心地はどうだ？", "zh": "不，没关系的。\n更重要的是，琴叶，新服装穿起来感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "7f6482017124ae9eaa5eb996e30622be4d33fc4c23429dd60d6fa6fd5bab4d41", "ja": "そうですね……この衣装、見た目が華やかなだけじゃ\nないんです。すごく、細かく作り込まれていて……。", "zh": "这个嘛……这件服装不只看起来华美，\n做工也非常细腻精致……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "04d66f0ea5f233cc8e67fedd5cc904c70e68198a4fa0ffbc8b1f0136936950b6", "ja": "見てください。装飾の花も、こんなにたくさん……\nとっても、かわいいですよね？", "zh": "请看，就连装饰用的花也有这么多……\n非常可爱对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5043db194f8a55d7faefb871329ef7ade5352aa7b89f707d5d907ad094c96a12", "ja": "うん、確かに可愛いな。\nそれに、琴葉によく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "嗯，的确很可爱呢，\n而且非常适合琴叶喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "633435b832e48bc9950ce0dd98725a606d2b025843af7a6d3bf672587e1bf0cc", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nとても素敵な衣装で、私も気に入っています。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n这件服装非常美丽，我也相当中意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "694158b93102550db20957f4089710dd0e85e3aa511da45f5790ed45529f6478", "ja": "{$P$}、知ってますか？\nキンモクセイの花言葉って、謙虚と真実なんですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，你知道吗？\n丹桂的花语，是谦虚与真实喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d0a5e8949b25cc73d4511a60d0bdf8b757517ed501c1d5cd5c2e3bd63a9a4a19", "ja": "へえ、よく知ってたな。\n琴葉は、花言葉に詳しいのか？", "zh": "哦，真亏你晓得呢。\n你对花语很了解吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "8d67a59e875daeade9b8c32c649b4485e617358f46dba26cb1b65bafc52a43e9", "ja": "いえ、そうでもないんです。ただ、この衣装に\n愛着が湧いてしまって……調べてみたんです。", "zh": "不，倒也不是那样。\n只是对这件服装有了感情……所以就去查了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ed8f2e7d69e6f630ea329a2d8a9c9bb6bc7edf0ee48fd699bc54d93121a27350", "ja": "はは、なるほどな。でも、謙虚と真実か……。\n琴葉のイメージにぴったりな気がするよ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。不过，谦虚与真实啊……\n感觉非常符合琴叶的形象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "22adf98d0840d8d6f533a6c298255a585ccffa7d9e899665498b9dcf2c5c6844", "ja": "そんな、私なんて。PVで妖精を演じるとはいえ、\nキンモクセイのような華やかさは、とても……。", "zh": "你过奖了。虽然要在PV中饰演妖精，\n但我实在无法诠释丹桂特有的那种华丽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c2a12471c5f29ccef38d63861ab18c483e33cfe4c6c0e89b43162ebbcbe7a421", "ja": "ほら、そうやって。\n謙虚なのは合ってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "看吧，你又这么说。\n谦虚这点应该与你很相符吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "1877221aaee8016e9e9f55b0b77101af37b12fcfabf26761e7896232786a7d13", "ja": "うう……。でも、キンモクセイと私には、\n全然違うところもありますから。", "zh": "唔唔……\n不过，丹桂与我也有完全不同的地方喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "a8a468c4b15306e97bdbe03cf006b18915fed89689cd38cf4167e5667c0f7494", "ja": "キンモクセイの花って、小さくて綺麗ですけど……\n雨が降ると、すぐに散ってしまうんだそうです。", "zh": "丹桂的花虽然很娇小又美丽……\n可是听说只要一下雨，就会马上凋谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "3e97c983ca84ca7eb8a67bd528a2f900eabd5ede83af12594361d23d13a0772a", "ja": "でも私は、簡単に散ったりしませんから。\nトップアイドルになるまで、諦めません。……なんて。", "zh": "但是我可不会这么简单就凋零。\n在成为顶尖偶像之前，我是不会放弃的……我说说的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1016_p", "source_sha256": "db90ae700ea35f5ebd52300dabf71ef8046333f49c96ce3786e56607a1712a66", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ。\n琴葉なら、絶対に出来るって信じてるよ！", "zh": "嗯，就是这股气势。\n我相信琴叶你绝对办得到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0154_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "3070cec59e0dfb0c35e5f033ce6d8d5f525cc435dd279053a511ef0e68f6fde3", "ja": "はい！　でも、あの……私ひとりの力で、\nどうにもならなくなったら、その時は……。", "zh": "嗯！不过，那个……如果有光靠我一个人\n无法解决的问题时，那时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
